# SEC-005 — Security headers for the ReloPass SPA (relopass.com).
# Render Static Sites honor this Netlify-style `_headers` file; it ships in
# frontend/dist/ via Vite's publicDir copy. Each header value must be a single
# physical line (no wrapping). The CSP below was audited against the actual built
# bundle (see audit/execution-prompts/SEC-005-security-headers.md) — every allowed
# origin maps to a resource the app really loads. script-src carries NO
# 'unsafe-inline' and NO 'unsafe-eval'.
#
# Content-Security-Policy directive rationale:
#   default-src 'self'                      — deny-by-default; everything else is an explicit allowlist.
#   script-src  'self' us-assets.i.posthog.com
#                                           — app bundle is self-hosted; PostHog (src/analytics.ts,
#                                             wired in main.tsx) lazy-loads its recorder/array script
#                                             from us-assets. NO unsafe-inline / unsafe-eval.
#   worker-src  'self' unpkg.com            — react-pdf (admin form-template coordinate mapper) pulls
#                                             pdf.worker.min.mjs from unpkg (PdfCoordinateMapper.tsx).
#   style-src   'self' 'unsafe-inline'
#                                           — DOCUMENTED EXCEPTION: React inline style props and the
#                                             index.html loading splash require 'unsafe-inline' for
#                                             styles. This is style-only; script execution stays
#                                             locked down. Google Fonts removed — fonts self-hosted
#                                             via @fontsource/inter (PR #509), so no external CSS.
#   img-src     'self' data: https:         — flag CDN, OpenStreetMap tiles, inline data-URI icons.
#   font-src    'self' data:
#                                           — Inter is self-hosted (@fontsource woff2 served same-
#                                             origin = 'self'); no fonts.gstatic.com. data: kept for
#                                             any inline font payloads.
#   connect-src 'self' *.supabase.co wss://*.supabase.co api.relopass.com us.i.posthog.com us-assets.i.posthog.com
#                                           — FastAPI backend, Supabase REST + realtime WebSocket,
#                                             PostHog ingestion.
#   object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
#                                           — no plugins, no <base> hijack, no clickjacking.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://us-assets.i.posthog.com; worker-src 'self' https://unpkg.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co wss://*.supabase.co https://api.relopass.com https://us.i.posthog.com https://us-assets.i.posthog.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
